		Text: Stack
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Grow, Shrink and Base size
		Paragraph: Each `Item` starts from its `Base size` (by default, its content). The leftover space goes to the items in proportion to `Grow`, and the missing space is taken from them in proportion to `Shrink` times `Base size`.
